{"articleNo":"2375","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2375&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009 한국교원대학교 겨울계절수업 수학안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.11.24","hit":"15021","attachments":[{"name":"타대학수학신청원(2009).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2375&attachNo=1651"},{"name":"2009 한국교원대학교 동기 계절학기 시간표.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2375&attachNo=1975"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -3.4pt\">2009학년도 한국교원대학교 겨울 계절수업 수학 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">1. 수강 대상자 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 본교 재학생으로서 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2개학기 이상을 이수한 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 102.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -102.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 이수성적 평점평균이</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 3.0 이상인 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 102.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -102.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 학칙에 의하여 징계 받은 사실이 없는 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2. 수업 기간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> : 2009. 12. 14.(월) ~ 2010. 1. 1.(금) (3주간) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">3. 개설과목 및 강의시간 : 붙임 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(※ 대학소재지 : 충북 청원군 강내면)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">4. 수강 신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 131.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -131.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;가. 수강신청 마감일 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2009. 11. 27(금)까지 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 131.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -131.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;나. 수강신청 방법</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 131.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -131.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;o 타대학수강신청원 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 32.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;o 제출처 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">학부행정실(수강료 같이 납부)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;다. 최대 수강 신청 가능 학점 : 6학점</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">5. 수강료 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 1학점 당 22,000원(단, 실험. 실습. 실기과목은 시간당 2,000원을 추가)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(예 : 3-2-</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 10.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">(실험.실습.실기시간)일 경우 주당 실습 시간이 2시간이므로 4,000원 추가)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 131.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -131.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 환불 : 수강 취소가 승인된 학생에 대하여는 우리대학 수강료 환불규정에 의거 환불함</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">6. 성적 처리</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">성적 통지 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">2010. 1. 20.(수) 이후 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">우리 대학에서 소속 대학으로 통지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 36.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 성적은 100점 만점의 환산한 점수를 부여하여 소속 대학교로 일괄 통보함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">성적 조회 및 이의 신청 기한 :&nbsp; 2010. 1. 13.(수) ~ 1. 15.(금) 18:00까지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 이의 신청 방법 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">해당 교수에게 이의 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 36.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">수업 시간의 1/4 이상을 결석한 경우에는 그 교과목의 학점을 취득할 수 없으므로</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> F등급으로 평가함. (학칙 제62조 제2항)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">성적 통지는 개인</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">별로 발송하지 않으며, 해당 학생이 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\">우리 대학 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">학사정보시스템을</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">통해 직접 확인</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">7. 기타</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 18.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;사도교육원(기숙사) 입사 신청 문의는 사도교육원 행정실(☎ 043-230-3856)으로 문의하시기 바람.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
